  "description": "MUJHUV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H148 Dy10 N6 O70. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy5A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.623-3.935 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.81-114.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C96H148Dy10N6O70. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 20 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
